  "contract": "Crude Waterskin 802808 (rank 1) comes with the Bushcraft skill at creation (SkillLineAbility 86420, SkillLine 505, AcquireMethod 2). Ranks 2-8 (802810, 802812-802817; Spell.dbc BaseLevel 14, 22, 30, 38, 44, 50, 56, the levels Exiles DB lists as 'Level required') are SkillLine 505 recipes with AcquireMethod 0 that no trainer, book or item taught. The Ranger class trainer (trainer 900021, Gustaf Blightflight 50281) and the Book of Ascension (SpellbookRankData) now sell each rank at its BaseLevel, requiring the rank below. A level-22 Ranger is offered rank 2 as available, rank 3 as unavailable until rank 2 is held, and rank 4 as unavailable below level 30; it buys ranks 2 and 3 from the trainer, is refused rank 4 at level 22, and buys rank 4 from the book at level 30. It does not test the client's window rendering.",
